  "primer": {
    "$comment": "Oxocarbon (dark) palette for gen-primer-theme. Source: https://github.com/nyoom-engineering/oxocarbon.nvim lua/oxocarbon/init.lua (MIT) — base00 #161616, base01..05 are blends of base00 toward base06 #ffffff at 0.085/0.18/0.3/0.82/0.95 (#2a2a2a #404040 #5c5c5c #d5d5d5 #f3f3f3), blend #131313, base07 #08bdba, base08 #3ddbd9, base09 #78a9ff, base10 #ee5396, base11 #33b1ff, base12 #ff7eb6, base13 #42be65, base14 #be95ff, base15 #82cfff; the grey #a8a8a8 is the theme's csv column grey. Base: @primer/primitives dark. Canvas base00, inset blend, raised base01, borders base02/base03, text base05 / muted #a8a8a8 (derived from the ramp: base04 is too close to the text), disabled base03-ish #6f6f6f. Accent + primary button + link base09 blue (dark text), success base13, danger base10. Oxocarbon has no yellow and no orange: attention is base14 purple (the theme's own WarningMsg colour), done is the same purple, severe and sponsors are base12 pink.",
